\h Nahum
\toc1 Nahum
\p
\rem From here on, this file is autogenerated by bibmark. You may edit the header section, as it will not be changed by bibmark.

\c 1
\p 
\v 1 \w The burden| strong="H4853" \w* \w of Nineveh| strong="H5210" \w*. \w The book| strong="H5612" \w* \w of the vision| strong="H2377" \w* \w of Nahum| strong="H5151" \w* \w the Elkoshite| strong="H512" \w*. 
\p
\v 2 \w God| strong="H410" \w* is \w jealous| strong="H7072" \w*, and the \sc Lord\sc* [revengeth]{strong=“H5358” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}; the \sc Lord\sc* [revengeth]{strong=“H5358” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, and is [furious]{strong=“H2534 H1167”}; the \sc Lord\sc* [will take vengeance]{strong=“H5358” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w on his adversaries| strong="H6862" \w*, [and he reserveth]{strong=“H5201” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} wrath [for his enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}.^\sc 1:2 God…: or, The [Lord\sc* is a jealous God, and a revenger, etc] \f + \fr 1:2 \ft is furious: Heb. that hath fury \f* 
\v 3 The \sc Lord\sc* is \w slow| strong="H750" \w* \w to anger| strong="H639" \w*, \w and great| strong="H1419" \w* \w in power| strong="H3581" \w*, [and will not at all]{strong=“H5352” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} [acquit]{strong=“H5352” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} the wicked: the \sc Lord\sc* \w hath his way| strong="H1870" \w* \w in the whirlwind| strong="H5492" \w* \w and in the storm| strong="H8183" \w*, \w and the clouds| strong="H6051" \w* are \w the dust| strong="H80" \w* \w of his feet| strong="H7272" \w*. 
\v 4 [He rebuketh]{strong=“H1605” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the sea| strong="H3220" \w*, [and maketh it dry]{strong=“H2717” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”}, [and drieth up]{strong=“H3001” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w all the rivers| strong="H5104" \w*: \w Bashan| strong="H1316" \w* [languisheth]{strong=“H535” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8797”}, \w and Carmel| strong="H3760" \w*, \w and the flower| strong="H6525" \w* \w of Lebanon| strong="H3844" \w* [languisheth]{strong=“H535” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8797”}. 
\v 5 \w The mountains| strong="H2022" \w* [quake]{strong=“H7493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [at him, and the hills]{strong=“H1389”} [melt]{strong=“H4127” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8712”}, \w and the earth| strong="H776" \w* [is burned]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w at his presence| strong="H6440" \w*, [yea, the world]{strong=“H8398”}, [and all that dwell]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} therein. 
\v 6 [Who can stand]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* \w his indignation| strong="H2195" \w*? [and who can abide]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in the fierceness| strong="H2740" \w* \w of his anger| strong="H639" \w*? \w his fury| strong="H2534" \w* [is poured out]{strong=“H5413” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w like fire| strong="H784" \w*, \w and the rocks| strong="H6697" \w* [are thrown down]{strong=“H5422” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} by him.\f + \fr 1:6 \ft abide: Heb. stand up \f* 
\v 7 The \sc Lord\sc* is \w good| strong="H2896" \w*, \w a strong hold| strong="H4581" \w* \w in the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w of trouble| strong="H6869" \w*; [and he knoweth]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [them that trust]{strong=“H2620” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} in him.\f + \fr 1:7 \ft strong hold: or, strength \f* 
\v 8 [But with an overrunning]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w flood| strong="H7858" \w* [he will make]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w an utter end| strong="H3617" \w* \w of the place| strong="H4725" \w* [thereof, and darkness]{strong=“H2822”} [shall pursue]{strong=“H7291” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [his enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. 
\p
\v 9 [What do ye imagine]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} against the \sc Lord\sc*? [he will make]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w an utter end| strong="H3617" \w*: \w affliction| strong="H6869" \w* [shall not rise up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the second time| strong="H6471" \w*. 
\v 10 For while they be [folden together]{strong=“H5440” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} as \w thorns| strong="H5518" \w*, [and while they are drunken]{strong=“H5433” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} as \w drunkards| strong="H5435" \w*, [they shall be devoured]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”} \w as stubble| strong="H7179" \w* \w fully| strong="H4392" \w* \w dry| strong="H3002" \w*. 
\v 11 There is one [come out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [of thee, that imagineth]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w evil| strong="H7451" \w* against the \sc Lord\sc*, \w a wicked| strong="H1100" \w* [counsellor]{strong=“H3289” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}.\f + \fr 1:11 \ft a wicked…: Heb. a counsellor of Belial \f* 
\v 12 [Thus saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc*; Though they be \w quiet| strong="H8003" \w*, \w and likewise many| strong="H7227" \w*, [yet thus shall they be cut down]{strong=“H1494” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}, [when he shall pass through]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}. [Though I have afflicted]{strong=“H6031” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [thee, I will afflict]{strong=“H6031” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} thee no more.\f + \fr 1:12 \ft Though…: or, If they would have been at peace, so should they have been many, and so should they have been shorn, and he should have passed away \f* \f + \fr 1:12 \ft cut down: Heb. shorn \f* 
\v 13 [For now will I break]{strong=“H7665” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his yoke| strong="H4132" \w* [from off thee, and will burst]{strong=“H5423”} \w thy bonds| strong="H4147" \w* [in sunder]{strong=“H5423” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}. 
\v 14 And the \sc Lord\sc* [hath given a commandment]{strong=“H6680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} concerning thee, that \w no more of thy name| strong="H8034" \w* [be sown]{strong=“H2232” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}: \w out of the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of thy gods| strong="H430" \w* [will I cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the graven image| strong="H6459" \w* \w and the molten image| strong="H4541" \w*: [I will make]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thy grave| strong="H6913" \w*; [for thou art vile]{strong=“H7043” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}. 
\v 15 \w Behold upon the mountains| strong="H2022" \w* \w the feet| strong="H7272" \w* [of him that bringeth good tidings]{strong=“H1319” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}, [that publisheth]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w peace| strong="H7965" \w*! \w O Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, [keep]{strong=“H2287” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thy solemn feasts| strong="H2282" \w*, [perform]{strong=“H7999” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} \w thy vows| strong="H5088" \w*: \w for the wicked| strong="H1100" \w* [shall no more]{strong=“H3254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [pass through]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [thee; he is utterly cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}.\f + \fr 1:15 \ft keep…: Heb. feast \f* \f + \fr 1:15 \ft the wicked: Heb. Belial \f*
\c 2
\p 
\v 1 [He that dasheth in pieces]{strong=“H6327” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} [is come up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w before thy face| strong="H6440" \w*: [keep]{strong=“H5341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w the munition| strong="H4694" \w*, [watch]{strong=“H6822” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} \w the way| strong="H1870" \w*, make thy \w loins| strong="H4975" \w* [strong]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”}, [fortify]{strong=“H553” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} thy \w power| strong="H3581" \w* \w mightily| strong="H3966" \w*.\f + \fr 2:1 \ft He…: or, The disperser, or, hammer \f* 
\v 2 For the \sc Lord\sc* [hath turned away]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the excellency| strong="H1347" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*, \w as the excellency| strong="H1347" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*: [for the emptiers]{strong=“H1238” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [have emptied them out]{strong=“H1238” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and marred]{strong=“H7843” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w their vine branches| strong="H2156" \w*.\f + \fr 2:2 \ft the excellency of Jacob…: or, the pride of Jacob as the pride, etc \f* 
\v 3 \w The shield| strong="H4043" \w* \w of his mighty men| strong="H1368" \w* [is made red]{strong=“H119” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8794”}, \w the valiant| strong="H2428" \w* \w men| strong="H582" \w* are [in scarlet]{strong=“H8529” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8794”}: \w the chariots| strong="H7393" \w* shall be \w with flaming| strong="H784" \w* \w torches| strong="H6393" \w* \w in the day| strong="H3117" \w* [of his preparation]{strong=“H3559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”}, \w and the fir trees| strong="H1265" \w* [shall be terribly shaken]{strong=“H7477” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8717”}.\f + \fr 2:3 \ft in scarlet: or, dyed scarlet \f* \f + \fr 2:3 \ft flaming: or, fiery \f* 
\v 4 \w The chariots| strong="H7393" \w* [shall rage]{strong=“H1984” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8704”} \w in the streets| strong="H2351" \w*, [they shall justle one against another]{strong=“H8264” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8698”} \w in the broad ways| strong="H7339" \w*: \w they shall seem| strong="H4758" \w* \w like torches| strong="H3940" \w*, [they shall run]{strong=“H7323” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8787”} \w like the lightnings| strong="H1300" \w*.\f + \fr 2:4 \ft they: Heb. their show \f* 
\v 5 [He shall recount]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his worthies| strong="H117" \w*: [they shall stumble]{strong=“H3782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w in their walk| strong="H1979" \w*; [they shall make haste]{strong=“H4116” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w to the wall| strong="H2346" \w* [thereof, and the defence]{strong=“H5526” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [shall be prepared]{strong=“H3559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8717”}.\f + \fr 2:5 \ft worthies: or, gallants \f* \f + \fr 2:5 \ft defence: Heb. covering, or, coverer \f* 
\v 6 \w The gates| strong="H8179" \w* \w of the rivers| strong="H5104" \w* [shall be opened]{strong=“H6605” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}, \w and the palace| strong="H1964" \w* [shall be dissolved]{strong=“H4127” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}.\f + \fr 2:6 \ft dissolved: or, molten \f* 
\v 7 [And Huzzab]{strong=“H5324” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8717”} [shall be led away captive]{strong=“H1540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”}, [she shall be brought up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8717”}, \w and her maids| strong="H519" \w* [shall lead]{strong=“H5090” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} her \w as with the voice| strong="H6963" \w* \w of doves| strong="H3123" \w*, [tabering]{strong=“H8608” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8781”} \w upon their breasts| strong="H3824" \w*.\f + \fr 2:7 \ft Huzzab: or, that which was established, or, there was a stand made \f* \f + \fr 2:7 \ft led…: or, discovered \f* 
\v 8 \w But Nineveh| strong="H5210" \w* is \w of old| strong="H3117" \w* \w like a pool| strong="H1295" \w* \w of water| strong="H4325" \w*: [yet they shall flee away]{strong=“H5127” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”}. [Stand]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [stand]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, shall they cry; [but none shall look back]{strong=“H6437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}.\f + \fr 2:8 \ft of old: or, from the days that she hath been \f* \f + \fr 2:8 \ft look back: or, cause them to turn \f* 
\v 9 [Take ye the spoil]{strong=“H962” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w of silver| strong="H3701" \w*, [take the spoil]{strong=“H962” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w of gold| strong="H2091" \w*: for there is \w none end| strong="H7097" \w* \w of the store| strong="H8498" \w* and \w glory| strong="H3519" \w* \w out of all the pleasant| strong="H2532" \w* \w furniture| strong="H3627" \w*.\f + \fr 2:9 \ft for…: or, and their infinite store, etc \f* \f + \fr 2:9 \ft pleasant…: Heb. vessels of desire \f* 
\v 10 \w She is empty| strong="H950" \w*, \w and void| strong="H4003" \w*, [and waste]{strong=“H1110” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8794”}: \w and the heart| strong="H3820" \w* [melteth]{strong=“H4549” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}, \w and the knees| strong="H1290" \w* \w smite together| strong="H6375" \w*, \w and much pain| strong="H2479" \w* is \w in all loins| strong="H4975" \w*, \w and the faces| strong="H6440" \w* [of them all gather]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w blackness| strong="H6289" \w*. 
\p
\v 11 Where is \w the dwelling| strong="H4583" \w* \w of the lions| strong="H738" \w*, \w and the feedingplace| strong="H4829" \w* \w of the young lions| strong="H3715" \w*, \w where the lion| strong="H738" \w*, even \w the old lion| strong="H3833" \w*, [walked]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, and [the lion’s]{strong=“H738”} \w whelp| strong="H1482" \w*, and none made them [afraid]{strong=“H2729” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}? 
\v 12 \w The lion| strong="H738" \w* [did tear in pieces]{strong=“H2963” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w enough| strong="H1767" \w* \w for his whelps| strong="H1484" \w*, [and strangled]{strong=“H2614” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w for his lionesses| strong="H3833" \w*, [and filled]{strong=“H4390” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w his holes| strong="H2356" \w* \w with prey| strong="H2964" \w*, \w and his dens| strong="H4585" \w* \w with ravin| strong="H2966" \w*. 
\v 13 Behold, I am [against thee, saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*, [and I will burn]{strong=“H1197” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w her chariots| strong="H7393" \w* \w in the smoke| strong="H6227" \w*, \w and the sword| strong="H2719" \w* [shall devour]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thy young lions| strong="H3715" \w*: [and I will cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w thy prey| strong="H2964" \w* \w from the earth| strong="H776" \w*, \w and the voice| strong="H6963" \w* \w of thy messengers| strong="H4397" \w* [shall no more be heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}. 
\c 3
\p 
\v 1 \w Woe| strong="H1945" \w* \w to the bloody| strong="H1818" \w* \w city| strong="H5892" \w*! it is \w all full| strong="H4392" \w* \w of lies| strong="H3585" \w* and \w robbery| strong="H6563" \w*; \w the prey| strong="H2964" \w* [departeth]{strong=“H4185” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} not;\f + \fr 3:1 \ft bloody…: Heb. city of bloods \f* 
\v 2 \w The noise| strong="H6963" \w* \w of a whip| strong="H7752" \w*, \w and the noise| strong="H6963" \w* \w of the rattling| strong="H7494" \w* \w of the wheels| strong="H212" \w*, [and of the pransing]{strong=“H1725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w horses| strong="H5483" \w*, [and of the jumping]{strong=“H7540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w chariots| strong="H4818" \w*. 
\v 3 \w The horseman| strong="H6571" \w* [lifteth up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w both the bright| strong="H3851" \w* \w sword| strong="H2719" \w* \w and the glittering| strong="H1300" \w* \w spear| strong="H2595" \w*: and there is \w a multitude| strong="H7230" \w* \w of slain| strong="H2491" \w*, \w and a great| strong="H3514" \w* \w number of carcases| strong="H6297" \w*; and there is \w none end| strong="H7097" \w* of their \w corpses| strong="H1472" \w*; [they stumble]{strong=“H3782 H3782” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8675 strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w upon their corpses| strong="H1472" \w*:\f + \fr 3:3 \ft the bright…: Heb. the flame of the sword, and the lightning of the spear \f* 
\v 4 \w Because of the multitude| strong="H7230" \w* \w of the whoredoms| strong="H2183" \w* [of the wellfavoured]{strong=“H2580 H2896”} [harlot]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w the mistress| strong="H1172" \w* \w of witchcrafts| strong="H3785" \w*, [that selleth]{strong=“H4376” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w nations| strong="H1471" \w* \w through her whoredoms| strong="H2183" \w*, \w and families| strong="H4940" \w* \w through her witchcrafts| strong="H3785" \w*. 
\v 5 Behold, I am [against thee, saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w*; [and I will discover]{strong=“H1540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w thy skirts| strong="H7757" \w* \w upon thy face| strong="H6440" \w*, [and I will shew]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the nations| strong="H1471" \w* \w thy nakedness| strong="H4626" \w*, \w and the kingdoms| strong="H4467" \w* \w thy shame| strong="H7036" \w*. 
\v 6 [And I will cast]{strong=“H7993” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w abominable filth| strong="H8251" \w* [upon thee, and make thee vile]{strong=“H5034” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”}, [and will set]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w thee as a gazingstock| strong="H7210" \w*. 
\v 7 And it shall come to pass, that [all they that look]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [upon thee shall flee]{strong=“H5074” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [from thee, and say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w Nineveh| strong="H5210" \w* [is laid waste]{strong=“H7703” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”}: [who will bemoan]{strong=“H5110” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [her? whence]{strong=“H370”} [shall I seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [comforters]{strong=“H5162” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} for thee? 
\p
\v 8 [Art thou better]{strong=“H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [than populous]{strong=“H528 H527” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8675”} \w No| strong="H4996" \w*, [that was situate]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w among the rivers| strong="H2975" \w*, that had \w the waters| strong="H4325" \w* \w round about| strong="H5439" \w* [it, whose rampart]{strong=“H2426”} was \w the sea| strong="H3220" \w*, and \w her wall| strong="H2346" \w* was \w from the sea| strong="H3220" \w*?\f + \fr 3:8 \ft populous…: or, nourishing, etc: Heb. No Amon \f* 
\v 9 \w Ethiopia| strong="H3568" \w* \w and Egypt| strong="H4714" \w* were \w her strength| strong="H6109" \w*, and it was [infinite]{strong=“H7097 H369”}; \w Put| strong="H6316" \w* \w and Lubim| strong="H3864" \w* \w were thy helpers| strong="H5833" \w*.\f + \fr 3:9 \ft thy helpers: Heb. in thy help \f* 
\v 10 Yet was \w she carried away| strong="H1473" \w*, [she went]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w into captivity| strong="H7628" \w*: \w her young children| strong="H5768" \w* [also were dashed in pieces]{strong=“H7376” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8792”} \w at the top| strong="H7218" \w* \w of all the streets| strong="H2351" \w*: [and they cast]{strong=“H3032” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w lots| strong="H1486" \w* [for her honourable men]{strong=“H3513” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}, \w and all her great men| strong="H1419" \w* [were bound]{strong=“H7576” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”} \w in chains| strong="H2131" \w*. 
\v 11 [Thou also shalt be drunken]{strong=“H7937” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: [thou shalt be hid]{strong=“H5956” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}, [thou also shalt seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w strength| strong="H4581" \w* [because of the enemy]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. 
\v 12 \w All thy strong holds| strong="H4013" \w* shall be like \w fig trees| strong="H8384" \w* \w with the firstripe figs| strong="H1061" \w*: [if they be shaken]{strong=“H5128” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}, [they shall even fall]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w into the mouth| strong="H6310" \w* [of the eater]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. 
\v 13 [Behold, thy people]{strong=“H5971”} \w in the midst| strong="H7130" \w* of thee are \w women| strong="H802" \w*: \w the gates| strong="H8179" \w* \w of thy land| strong="H776" \w* [shall be set wide]{strong=“H6605” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [open]{strong=“H6605” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [unto thine enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}: \w the fire| strong="H784" \w* [shall devour]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w thy bars| strong="H1280" \w*. 
\v 14 [Draw]{strong=“H7579” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thee waters| strong="H4325" \w* \w for the siege| strong="H4692" \w*, [fortify]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} \w thy strong holds| strong="H4013" \w*: [go]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w into clay| strong="H2916" \w*, [and tread]{strong=“H7429” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w the morter| strong="H2563" \w*, [make strong]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} \w the brickkiln| strong="H4404" \w*. 
\v 15 \w There shall the fire| strong="H784" \w* [devour]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [thee; the sword]{strong=“H2719”} [shall cut thee off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [it shall eat thee up]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w like the cankerworm| strong="H3218" \w*: [make thyself many]{strong=“H3513” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8690”} \w as the cankerworm| strong="H3218" \w*, [make thyself many]{strong=“H3513” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8690”} \w as the locusts| strong="H697" \w*. 
\v 16 [Thou hast multiplied]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [thy merchants]{strong=“H7402” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w above the stars| strong="H3556" \w* \w of heaven| strong="H8064" \w*: \w the cankerworm| strong="H3218" \w* [spoileth]{strong=“H6584” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and flieth away]{strong=“H5774” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 3:16 \ft spoileth: or, spreadeth himself \f* 
\v 17 \w Thy crowned| strong="H4502" \w* are \w as the locusts| strong="H697" \w*, \w and thy captains| strong="H2951" \w* \w as the great grasshoppers| strong="H1462" \w*, [which camp]{strong=“H2583” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in the hedges| strong="H1448" \w* \w in the cold| strong="H7135" \w* \w day| strong="H3117" \w*, but \w when the sun| strong="H8121" \w* [ariseth]{strong=“H2224” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [they flee away]{strong=“H5074” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8776”}, \w and their place| strong="H4725" \w* [is not known]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w where| strong="H335" \w* they are. 
\v 18 [Thy shepherds]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [slumber]{strong=“H5123” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w O king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Assyria| strong="H804" \w*: \w thy nobles| strong="H117" \w* [shall dwell]{strong=“H7931” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} in the dust: \w thy people| strong="H5971" \w* [is scattered]{strong=“H6335” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w upon the mountains| strong="H2022" \w*, [and no man gathereth]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} them.\f + \fr 3:18 \ft nobles: or, valiant ones \f* 
\v 19 There is \w no healing| strong="H3545" \w* \w of thy bruise| strong="H7667" \w*; \w thy wound| strong="H4347" \w* [is grievous]{strong=“H2470” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}: [all that hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the bruit| strong="H8088" \w* [of thee shall clap]{strong=“H8628” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the hands| strong="H3709" \w* [over thee: for upon whom hath not thy wickedness]{strong=“H7451”} [passed]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w continually| strong="H8548" \w*?\f + \fr 3:19 \ft healing: Heb. wrinkling \f* 
